<title>USA: Manufactured Home to buy back one mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Manufactured Home to buy back one mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manufactured Home Communities Inc said Wednesday its directors had authorized the repurchase of up to one million shares of its outstanding stock.</p>
<p>The shares may be purchased through open market or privately negotiated transactions, the company said.</p>
<p>Manufactured Home also said its board had approved a regular quarterly dividend of $0.33 a share, payable July 11, record June 27.  </p>
<p>Manufactured Home has about 25 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Shares of Manufactured Home were unchanged at 21-3/8.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
